# Docs

## Two doc families

| Location | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `docs/standards/` | Engineering: architecture, frontend/backend rules, feature playbook |
| `docs/` root (DEPLOY, FAQ, CHEATSHEET, RISK, CRASH card) | Field install and staff ops |

## Must follow

- Coding / structure changes → update `docs/standards/` (and root `README.md` API table when endpoints change)
- Install / LAN / staff workflow → edit the matching ops markdown; regenerate HTML/PDF only when those artifacts are part of the task
- Do not rewrite field PDFs or cheat sheets for pure code refactors
- Do not move ops content into `.cursor/rules` — rules stay short and point at standards
- Keep `docs/standards/README.md` as the onboarding index (“where do I look?”)
